            | This work is licensed under
            a(rel="license", href="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/") Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
            | .
            br
            br
            | Photo credit:
            a(href='https://www.pexels.com/photo/futuristic-cyberpunk-ai-portrait-with-glowing-eyes-37911407/') Shubham Dhage
